---
import { author } from '../data/projects';
---

<section id="donasi" class="border-b border-neutral-900">
	<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-12 px-6 py-20 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
		<div class="text-center">
			<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-500">Donasi</p>
			<h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">Dukung Pengembangan</h2>
			<p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm text-neutral-600">
				Apresiasi karya ini dengan traktiran kopi melalui pemindaian QRIS di bawah ini.
			</p>
			<img
				src="/qris.png"
				alt="QRIS Donasi"
				width="240"
				height="240"
				class="mx-auto mt-8 border border-neutral-900 p-3 grayscale"
			/>
		</div>

		<div class="border-t border-neutral-900 pt-10 md:border-t-0 md:border-l md:pt-0 md:pl-12">
			<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-neutral-500">Pengembang</p>
			<h3 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">{author.name}</h3>
			<p class="mt-2 font-mono text-sm text-neutral-600">{author.role}</p>
			<p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">
				Pengembang di balik kelima sistem ini. Karya tersedia sebagai paket source code siap pakai
				dengan lisensi terdaftar untuk setiap pembeli.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-8 space-y-3">
				<a
					href={author.portfolio}
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener"
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-neutral-900 px-5 py-2.5 font-mono text-sm font-semibold transition hover:bg-neutral-900 hover:text-white"
				>
					Lihat Portofolio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
				</a>
				<p class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500">{author.email}</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>